        "text": "Page: Brad Elterman. Sentence: Brad Elterman is a professional photographer from Beverly Hills, California, who addressed the rock 'n' roll lifestyle in Hollywood encompassing pop, punk and rock bands that included the Faces with Rod Stewart, David Bowie, Robert Plant, Sex Pistols, the Runaways, Bebe Buell, Kiss, Queen, Blondie, the Ramones, Bay City Rollers, ABBA, Boney M, Kenny Rogers, The Who, Leif Garrett, Michael Jackson, among others.\nPage: Blondie (band). Sentence: Blondie is an American rock band founded by singer Debbie Harry and guitarist Chris Stein.\nPage: Blondie (band). Sentence: Over the next three years, the band achieved several hit singles including \"Call Me\", \"Rapture\" and \"Heart of Glass\" and became noted for its eclectic mix of musical styles incorporating elements of disco, pop, reggae, and early rap music.",
